So hard to see what's right in front of you, indeed.

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:30.820
Yeah.

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:33.590
I thought I'd replenish some sugar during my break.

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:34.470
Donuts, huh?

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:35.560
Donuts, isn't it?

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:37.220
It must be donuts.

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:40.140
Well, yeah, it's donuts.

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:42.670
Donuts, you say! That's wonderful!

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:46.890
Now, my master, present those donuts to me
without wasting another moment!

00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:01.410
My master?

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:02.410
What?

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:03.750
What's this?

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:06.040
Are they new items from Mister Donut?

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:07.290
Oh, no.

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:09.790
Senjougahara was just here.

00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:13.170
She gave me these donuts as a care package.

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:14.800
For what purpose?

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:17.400
Well, that's because...

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:20.610
It was to cheer me on as I study for entrance exams.

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:22.350
<b>COST</b>

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:22.350
<b>PERFORMANCE</b>

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:22.350
It's cheaper to just buy them.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:26.220
Senjougahara made me these donuts for free.

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:30.250
You didn't pay any money?

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:34.750
I've never heard of a girlfriend who demands money for the gifts she offers.

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:36.650
That can't be!

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:39.050
Not that scrooge!{TN: wtf is "miser" never heard of that; after looking up it means pretty much the same as "being a scrooge", which prolly more non-native english speaker understand better than "miser"}

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:42.560
You should be careful.

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:44.370
There might be something in them.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:47.910
Wait, how can you think that way about someone's girlfriend?

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:51.110
If anything's in them, it would be love and stuff.

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:54.120
You experienced last month how even love

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:56.440
can turn into poison depending on how you cook it.

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:07.430
What's this hole?

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:09.310
Hole?

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:11.110
There's a strange hole.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:15.020
Perhaps she injected something here.

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:17.880
No, don't slip in some cliché joke.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.590
Donuts are supposed to have holes in them.

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:21.530
Why?

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:26.380
Donuts with holes like that are the type called torus donuts.

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:28.400
By putting a hole in the center,

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:31.310
it allows the heat to be more evenly distributed while frying.

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:34.040
So this shape is called a torus?

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:39.670
You can tell whether or not it's poisoned by doing a taste test.

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:42.540
Are you ordering me to be your taster?

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:45.320
What a merciless master you are!

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:47.050
I'm at a loss for words!

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:48.410
Let me warn you.

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:52.390
I don't think any random donut is acceptable, you see?

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:55.230
If you want to avoid my investigation,

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:58.230
head over to the Shinobu branch of Mister Donut,

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:02.030
and buy me their new release,
the raw Pon de Ring Choco-Golden!

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:03.670
Can you believe it?

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:07.010
A "raw" version of the Pon de Ring is a stroke of genius,

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:10.620
but they further arranged it to be like a Golden Chocolate!

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:13.370
I haven't eaten one yet, but the taste...

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:17.750
Just imagining it, I can already feel it
spreading through my whole mouth.

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:22.260
I'm sure I won't be afraid of others judging me and will shout like this:

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:24.630
Japa-mazing!

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.390
<b>SOMEHOW, IT TURNED INTO A CRY PRAISING THE COUNTRY OF JAPAN.</b>

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:39.500
Well done!

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.750
Summon that tsundere girl!

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.550
I want to compliment her in person!

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:46.100
You've gone this long with almost no connection to Senjougahara.

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:49.130
Meeting her because you bonded with her donuts is absurd.

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:53.040
What are you doing?

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:55.380
No, what are you doing?

00:04:55.380 --> 00:04:57.040
I'm not done testing for poison.

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:58.600
No, you're done.

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:01.730
You ate one normally, and said it was delicious, too.

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:02.890
I don't know...

00:05:02.890 --> 00:05:04.730
It could be a slow-acting venom.

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:08.860
So, I'll continue the poison testing.

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:13.570
If I compare about four more test patterns,
the results will form on their own.

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:14.600
Four more patterns?

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:18.020
Hey, Shinobu...

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:22.210
From what I see, there seems to be exactly four donuts left.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:24.190
Oh, it's perfect!

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:26.880
That's such a coincidence. How ideal that is!

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:27.590
It's not.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:30.710
You intentionally manipulated the number of experiments.

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:32.470
Hand over that plate.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:33.470
Negative.

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:35.840
As a servant of my master,

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:39.690
it's my responsibility to protect you
from all risks, no matter how small.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:42.460
Don't act like the servant only when it's convenient!

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:44.480
This is your final warning, Shinobu.

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:46.380
Hand that plate to me.

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:47.210
Ka-ka!

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:49.720
You really are terrible at negotiating.

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:54.840
You don't budge from that resolute attitude,
and repeat "hand it over" like a broken record.

00:05:54.840 --> 00:06:01.030
Isn't that why the talisman the boss specialist
entrusted you with was taken back?

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:05.650
If you'd been able to negotiate better back then,

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:08.640
