00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:08.590
The donut was already cut in half to begin with,

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:12.610
so there's no need to do anything new to the hard outer shell.

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:16.410
More like, the cream would work as the glue after she shoved it in?

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:19.470
That said, we have no proof.

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:22.120
Because you already ate the proof, Araragi-kun.

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:28.330
<i>In that way, you could say Shinobu-chan hid the donut in your stomach.</i>

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:32.600
But isn't that no good at all?

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:36.480
<i>Shinobu's objective was to eat the donuts, right?</i>

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:40.460
<i>But if she had me eat them, that defeats the purpose.</i>

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:42.610
<i>It doesn't accomplish the objective at all.</i>

00:10:42.610 --> 00:10:45.100
That's exactly the point, Araragi-kun.

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:46.220
ARARAGI KOYOMI

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:46.220
ARARAGI KOYOMI

00:10:48.030 --> 00:10:49.040
I mean...

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:52.730
Abandoning your own profits or objectives.

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:55.540
To not bring in personal bias.

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:57.070
In other words,

00:10:57.070 --> 00:10:58.570
you relinquish it.

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:00.070
To be selfless.

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:03.740
That's the point Shinobu-chan taught you.

00:11:04.340 --> 00:11:08.010
ARARAGI KOYOMI

00:11:04.340 --> 00:11:08.010
ARARAGI KOYOMI

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:08.010
<i>Point for what? Negotiation? Secrecy?</i>

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:12.500
Of love.

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:40.860
<b>Nayami ketobashite ishi ga korogatte ku</b>

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:40.860
<b>Kicking a stone as if I was kicking my troubles</b>

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:46.620
<b>Sukoshi gomakashita are wa shigatsu no koto</b>

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:46.620
<b>It was April when I played my trick</b>

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:52.080
<b>Koukishin ousei de akarui kodomo deshita</b>

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:52.080
<b>I was a curious and cheerful child</b>

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:57.840
<b>Senaka oshita no wa ano hi kara no boku de</b>

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:57.840
<b>The me from the past gave me a push</b>

00:11:58.340 --> 00:12:03.720
<b>Hamidasenai retsu wo oinuite</b>

00:11:58.340 --> 00:12:03.720
<b>Let's loiter on the way</b>

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:09.310
<b>Michikusa wo shiyou</b>

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:09.310
<b>Passing a line you can't even lean out from</b>

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:16.980
<b>Kago ni nose taisetsu na yume</b>

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:16.980
<b>I'll put my precious dreams in the basket</b>

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:22.360
<b>pedaru mawashi tooku made saa mochi dasou</b>

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:22.360
<b>and spin the pedals, carrying them far away!</b>

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:27.740
<b>Uwasa shita boku no mirai wa</b>

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:27.740
<b>My rumored future...</b>

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:29.540
<b>Kokochi iino?</b>

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:29.540
<b>Am I comfortable with it?</b>

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:32.830
<b>Nobiru kage ni kiitemo</b>

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:32.830
<b>I even asked my long shadow;</b>

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:41.670
<b>Wakaranai wakaranai wakaranai</b>

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:35.870
<b>It doesn't know a thing...</b>

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:38.630
<b>It doesn't know a thing...</b>

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:41.670
<b>It doesn't know a thing...</b>
